<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζητ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>disposed to search</i> or <i>inquire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				81e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i>into</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				366b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					528c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ζ. διάλογοι</span> Plato's dialogues
				<i>of search</i> or <i>investigation</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὑφηγητικοί</span>, Thrasyll. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				3.49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ζ. ἔχουσι πάντες οἱ τοῦ
				Σωκράτους λόγοι</span> are <i>devoted to search</i> or
				<i>inquiry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1265a12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.515S.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ζητητικοί</span>, a name given to
				<i>the Sceptics</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ζητητική</span>
			<i>their philosophy</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ζ. ἀγωγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
